---
title: Limits
pageSlug: limits
mod: tikfinitok
section: faq
order: 3
---

- Dedicated servers are **not** supported. Use the integrated server (singleplayer or LAN host).
- The world must be open and loaded or commands will not run.
- Commands execute on the integrated server thread.
- Download the JAR that matches your Minecraft version. Mixing versions will not load.

If TikFinity cannot connect, confirm port `4567` (or your toml override), cheats enabled, and that the in-game name matches the TikFinity username field.
